From a3991edb37c66119cb0ba18497425aa23c9e4195 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 05:14:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Autosave owner reference photos per-shot instead of
 batching to one Save

Opening the native camera repeatedly is memory-heavy, and Android can
reclaim the app's memory while it's open, restarting the app back to its
home screen. Since reference photos were only uploaded on a final "Save"
press, that restart wiped out every photo taken in that session. Each
photo now uploads immediately after capture so progress always survives.
---
