From 70de7ad9ae57c3d134c226968cc438e2779a53c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 05:41:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Redesign driver app: fintech design tokens, Inspection
 tab, avatar profile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add nude/emerald/gold design-system tokens to theme.ts alongside the
  existing brand colors so untouched screens keep their current look while
  new screens opt into the redesigned palette.
- Give the driver app its own Inspection tab (right after Home): a due-date
  card, a Start inspection button, and a condensed history preview backed
  by real inspection data.
- Move Profile off the tab bar onto a header avatar (Home/Inspection/
  Activity/Rental), keeping the bar at four tabs instead of growing to five.
- Rebuild Home with card-based hierarchy per the approved mockup: active
  rental, needs-attention, TrustScore (now with a gold progress ring), and
  real recent activity — no map on Home.
- Rental drops its inspection-capture button (redundant now that Inspection
  owns that CTA) in favor of a link to the Inspection tab.
---
